**[Suggestion]** Maintainer list duplicated in 3 places with no shared source of truth — Concrete cost: adding or removing a core maintainer requires coordinated edits in `MAINTAINERS` (script), the `if:` condition (YAML), and the `maintainers=` shell variable. Missing one silently breaks routing — e.g., a maintainer added to the script but not to the shell variable remains assigned as a reviewer when the workflow's diff-guard should have removed them.

```suggestion
const MAINTAINERS = ['wenshao', 'tanzhenxin', 'yiliang114', 'LaZzyMan'];
// NOTE: this list is canonical. Keep the YAML `if:` condition and
// the apply-step `maintainers=` variable in sync.
```

_— qwen3.7-max via Qwen Code /review_
